c) The claimant is entitled for total compensation at .6,30,401/- as against .3,82,901/- awarded by the Tribunal;
d) The enhanced compensation shall carry interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of its realization;
e) The respondent-Insurer is directed to deposit the compensation amount along with interest within eight weeks from the date of receipt of certified copy of this judgment;
f) The deposit and disbursement shall be made as per the award of the Tribunal;
g) No order as to costs.
